<title>USA: K-III sets 12.5 mln share offering.</title>
<headline>K-III sets 12.5 mln share offering.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>K-III Communications Corp said Tuesday it proposed a public offering of about 12.5 million shares.</p>
<p>K-III said it anticipated the offering would be made in April.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used to redeem the company's outstanding $2.875 senior exchangeable preferred stock and to repay debt, the company said.</p>
